	(text "The MUX has an input capacitance of 36pF \nwhen a switch is on, so subtract that \nfrom the last capacitor in each BPF\n\nOnly matters for low value capacitors who would be affected by this:\nC57 (300) -> (270)\nC58 (100) -> (68)"
